Upstream code in this repository
--------------------------------
Servo (third_party/servo), https://github.com/servo/servo, MPL-2.0.
  Based on 2b94d76a6971d2c41b6447b1b6d8251412d6ac72 plus 145 commits of ours (LucinaEngine). We changed: the JavaScript
  host API (Rust, over LucinaJS), the font, storage and network-policy components, the media element, the software
  render paths. Servo's web-platform-tests and performance pages are not copied. LICENSE_WHATWG_SPECS (BSD-3-Clause)
  covers specification text and stays with the fork.
WebRender and its glyph rasterizer (third_party/webrender, third_party/wr-glyph-rasterizer), MPL-2.0.
  Based on the crates webrender 0.70.1 and wr_glyph_rasterizer 0.70.1. The glyph rasterizer uses skrifa and zeno
  instead of FreeType; src/platform/unix/font.rs is derived from FreeType (third_party/wr-glyph-rasterizer/FTL.TXT).
swgl (swgl), MPL-2.0. Based on the crate swgl 0.70.0. swgl/res/Proggy.ttf is ProggyClean by Tristan Grimmer, MIT.
Stylo (third_party/stylo), https://github.com/servo/stylo at 890aa121c6aa930c1a3c52f307fd4ba5d9410068, MPL-2.0
  (servo_arc and malloc_size_of: MIT OR Apache-2.0). Unchanged.
Brimstone (third_party/brimstone), https://github.com/Hans-Halverson/brimstone, MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Hans Halverson.
  Based on 64d66980ce03f3c9c0a38a16d09e7fa056a1171d plus our commits (LucinaJS). The baked Intl data under
  third_party/brimstone/src/brimstone_intl_data is CLDR and Unicode data under the Unicode License v3, whose text is in
  third_party/brimstone/src/brimstone_intl_data/LICENSE.
LucinaJS glue (js), MPL-2.0, with the mozjs and mozjs-sys names and API of https://github.com/servo/mozjs 0.26.13.
  Rust only; no SpiderMonkey source is in this repository.
rav1d (third_party/rav1d), https://github.com/memorysafety/rav1d at 2e7216c20ac2a75de204d6c8d7268b75a45959b4, BSD-2-Clause
  (COPYING: VideoLAN and the Internet Security Research Group; Copyright of the dav1d authors). Unchanged.
indexmap-allocator-api (third_party/indexmap-allocator-api), https://github.com/Hans-Halverson/indexmap-allocator-api,
  Apache-2.0 OR MIT. Unchanged.
Blitz (third_party/blitz, blitz), https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz at d0f48bd17224130c3697b9c6a2de9c090cfdebc7 plus 2
  commits, MIT OR Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE). Kept as a rendering comparison; the browser build does not use it.
LucinaOS crates (lucinaos), https://github.com/gvitolocs/lucina at 5bd41b051d594a1b77b99b015c0c92ecf126aebb, MIT except the
  code listed in lucinaos/LICENSE. The eyra stack under lucinaos/third_party/eyra-stack is Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception OR
  Apache-2.0 OR MIT (its own LICENSE files).

